  "description": "Some days speed and efficiency are king, and we need to get to the finish line - fast. Other days, gravel roads beckon us to explore off the beaten path. With its split personality - both race-oriented and self-sufficient - the Buzzard is ready for it all. Our versatile carbon gravel bike has a long front triangle for stability and a short rear end with flared chain stays that make it easy to whip through tight singletrack. In-frame downtube storage and 18 mounts accommodate racks, fenders and panniers for multi-day adventure rides. Internal cable routing, UDH compatibility and space for wide tires (up to a 45c in the rear) make the Buzzard sleek and functional. Whether it's a quick gravel grind, a destination race, or an epic bikepacking adventure, the Buzzard will take you on roads less traveled.\nHitting the sweet spot in the Buzzard family, the Carbon 2 fits the bill for a performance gravel bike. With a SRAM Apex electronic groupset, FSA SC30 AGX carbon tubeless wheelset and Vittoria Terreno Dry gravel tires, it is everything you need to hit any road, anywhere.",
